{"id":"5908","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5908_main_stratocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">发白偏灰的层积云层</span>，有一些更阴暗的部分，并显示出与层状云种有关的相当扁平的云底。云层很薄或透光，可显露出太阳的位置；这是透光云类。此外，云素之间有空隙，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>上可透过这些空隙看到蓝天；这是漏隙云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stefan Kämpfe","location":"德国，图林根，魏玛","latitude":"纬度: 50° 58' 60'' N","longitude":"经度: 11° 19' 31'' E","date":"29 January 2016 0936 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 5, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.8","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.8"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5908_syn_stratocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>0600 UTC天气图显示出以法罗群岛附近为中心的955 hPa深低压，伴随的锋在英国和斯堪的纳维亚半岛南部快速东移。渐弱的暖锋正在接近图片拍摄位置。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5908_upper_stratocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>0000 UTC在德国迈宁根（WMO 10548）的探测显示出地表夜间逆温和接近900 hPa的薄湿层。在1200米之上，空气很干燥，直至卷云高度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5908_sat_stratocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>0900 UTC的Meteosat卫星红外云图显示出与法罗群岛附近深低压相关的活跃冷锋从挪威西南部附近延伸至英吉利海峡西部。在德国上空仅可看到浅灰色云的薄碎片（暖云顶温度）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2016","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}